[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i37"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦……那是。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识从路的那头跑了过来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"时不时停下脚步，对周围一通东张西望。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，她注意到了我。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12559"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“羽依里！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哟，你在找什么吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12453"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“找鬼哦！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，是要找鬼来着。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12456"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“今天我打听到的消息很不得了哦！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12453"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“居然是目击消息！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“目击？那确实挺不得了啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12456"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“对吧？可以理解为什么我会跑起来了吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“顺便问一下，这消息是谁告诉你的？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12453"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“就是那个突然脱衣服的变态！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“良一啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“原来他是你的朋友啊？”"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":34,"value":["==",["v",435],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，你前天不是也见过他吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12484"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“我只记得被你们包围住的事了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这么说来，识当时马上就逃跑了。"},{"op":"goto","target":34},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好吧，他是在这个岛上交到的朋友。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12489"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“喔……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识颇为感慨地笑着，同时却后退了一步。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……？为什么要后退？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12448"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“你也是变态吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“能不能别笑着说这么过分的话？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12481"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“对哦，你是鬼来着。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，鬼应该是你才对……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12452"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“咦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她一下就高兴了……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那么，良一是怎么说的？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12449"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“嗯！他说这个岛上存在一个从高处统治着岛民，拥有千里眼，能够砸下水神之铁锤的鬼！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“原来如此。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12453"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“而且还说他自己就挨过很多次水神之铁锤的制裁呢！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"知道得还挺清楚啊……"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12490"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“在哪里能见到这个鬼呢？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12449"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“既然说是从高处统治岛民，那应该会在山顶之类的地方吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你想见她吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12453"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“当然了！我想见他一面然后好好聊聊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这样啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"感觉如果不解开这些误会的话，以后可能会很麻烦。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那我给你露一手吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“咦？你认识那个鬼吗!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“差不多吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12449"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“太厉害了，羽依里！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12453"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“你怎么不早点告诉我啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这个嘛，有各种原因。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12490"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“在哪里能见到那个鬼呢？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“如果只是想见识一下鬼的力量的话，很简单。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我不是说了要露一手吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我把手搭在了衬衫上。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12466"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“……哎？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哈啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我突然脱掉了衬衫，裸露出了上半身。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“来吧！识，看着我！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12552"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“变态啊――――！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呀啊啊啊啊!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12478"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“呜哎哎哎哎哎哎！被击中了――――!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃啊……这、这就是……鬼的……水神之铁锤……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呃啊！等、等下！啊哈！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12466"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“羽依里!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i11788"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"‘那边的暴露狂，在海水浴场以外的地方禁止脱衣服！’"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这个声音……我也听到过。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12493"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“是在岛上的时候，偶尔会听到的天之声！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12453"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“那个声音的主人……就是鬼吗!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“野村美希……就是……那个鬼的名字……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12478"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“羽依里!!”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i37"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11786"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“不仅脱掉了衣服，还故意在小女孩面前显摆。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11789"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“鹰原，你原来不是变态，而是个可疑人士吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"美希来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这是有原因的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不如说，我这么做正是为了消除对你的误解。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11786"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“对我的误解？那是什么？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12453"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“那个，你是鬼吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11789"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“你是……之前在岛上见过几次的那个孩子啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“她叫识。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“这位是野村美希，大家都叫她野美希。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“然后，她手上拿着的就是水神之铁锤。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11699"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“水神之铁锤？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11701"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“不是的，这是Hydro Gladiator改。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12490"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“我在调查过去存在于这座岛上的鬼。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12453"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“你就是那个鬼吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“不，我只是少年团执行部的成员。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“居然不是鬼吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11750"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“嗯，虽然有时会被称作严厉的执法者，但我只是个普通人。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11777"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“如你所见，头上也没长角。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12571"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这样啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11712"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“我、我是不是说了什么不该说的话？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，我只是想把这个误会解开。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11709"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“原来如此。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11699"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“不过，说我是鬼的到底是谁……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11701"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“算了，不用说我也知――”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11840"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"突然，野美希像是发现了什么似的望向天空。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11842"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“刚才，那家伙脱了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……这你能知道？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11792"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"野美希没有回答，而是咔嚓一声给水枪加好了压。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11797"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“我要走了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，好的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11802"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12463"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“你叫识对吧。如果你留在岛上，我们应该还会再见面的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11801"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“那么再见。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"野美希端着Hydro跑开了。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“她手上好像拿着一把出神入化的东西，真的是人类吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……就是工作起来像个鬼罢了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12554"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“说起来……你能把衣服穿上吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12553"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“作为一个女孩子，实在不知道该把视线往哪放了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，抱歉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我转过身去背对着脸上冒红的识，重新穿上衬衫。"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12483"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“还有……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咕噜噜～……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“OK。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12501"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“你理解得很快，太感谢了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“毕竟我们也都很熟了啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“如果小卖铺可以的话，我带你一起去吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12449"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“那就拜托了。”"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“欢迎光临。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12478"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“呜哇啊啊啊啊!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12493"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“羽依里！这、这里是……天堂吗!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不，是小卖铺。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12453"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这里有这么多吃的啊！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“因为是小卖铺嘛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12449"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“可以随便吃喜欢的东西吗!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“当然不可以啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“付了钱才能拿走。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“不过呢，花个500日元左右就能吃得很奢侈了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯，你就先挑自己想吃的吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12498"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“虽然是这么说，可我看着看着就眼花缭乱了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“也是啊。”"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":236,"value":["==",["v",433],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对了，说起来，要不要买点之前带给你的御结饭团仙贝？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12449"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“好呀！就要那个。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“请问有饭团仙贝吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“不好意思啊，现在卖完了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，好可惜。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“说是卖完了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12498"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“卖完的话也没办法。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12490"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“有没有其他像御结饭团那样的三角形点心？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“为什么你非要饭团不可啊……”"},{"op":"goto","target":236},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“来买东西啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“欢迎光临。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"正当识犹豫不决的时候，岛上的小朋友们过来了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"岛上的男孩A","text":"“奶奶，我要刨冰。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“一百万日元。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"又开始了经典对话。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12478"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“什么!؟一、一百万日元!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12466"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“羽、羽依里，你听到了吗!؟这都能买栋房子了!!”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“冷静点，这是乡下的玩笑话。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"老奶奶转动着手动刨冰机的把手，刮着冰块。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“来，久等了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"还是和之前一样，堆得高高的。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12453"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“就要这个！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哈？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识看到刨冰，顿时两眼放光。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我们两个坐在店门口的长椅上吃起了刨冰。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i196"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12586"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“羽依里……我在想。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12572"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这个是不是不管吃多少都不会饱啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你才发现啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“刚才说想吃用冰做成的饭团的可是你哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12581"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“在我的眼里……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12595"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“这堆成小山的刨冰，就像是一个雪白的御结饭团呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“现在是鲜红的就是了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识点了草莓味，我点的则是蓝色夏威夷味的。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12464"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“老奶奶说的那个，这些真的都是一样的味道吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好像是的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我也是在这里吃过才知道的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“当时还挺震惊的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12497"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“从颜色上看完全不觉得一样呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“要尝尝我的吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我把自己的蓝色夏威夷味刨冰递给了识。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12488"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她用自己的勺子舀了一勺浇满糖浆的蓝色部分，吃了起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么样？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12485"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“……好像是一样的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12454"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“你也可以吃吃我的哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是吗？那……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12491"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识不知为何用自己勺子舀了一勺草莓味，递到了我面前。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12451"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“来吧，不用客气的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"她是不是下意识这么干的啊？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那样的话，我太在意这件事反倒会不解风情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那、那就……啊～……呜。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12491"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我怀着忐忑的心情张开嘴，含住了识的勺子吃下刨冰。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“你们感情真好呀。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唔咕呜!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12497"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“咳咳！咳咳！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12464"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“羽依里？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没、没事……只是刨冰卡在喉咙里了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"作为掩饰害羞的借口，这也太牵强了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“我还是头一次见到有人被刨冰噎住呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是啊……确实……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1280},{"op":"clear","layer":1536},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12453"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“对了，老奶奶一直都住在这座岛上吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“从出生起就在这家小卖铺了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这句话令我感到了一股历史的厚重感。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12490"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“我想问您点事，可以吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“什么事呀？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“老奶奶听说过这座岛上存在过鬼的传说吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“鬼……鬼啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“好像有过这样的传说……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12453"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“真的吗!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“又好像没有……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12472"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“不对，应该是有的……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12453"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“哦哦！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“又好像确实没有……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12478"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“到底有还是没有!؟”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“您是故意的对吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“毕竟是很久以前的事了嘛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12460"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“不管多小的事都行。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12493"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“如果还记得的话，请告诉我吧。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“好像我奶奶很久很久以前说过，神社那边留下过这样的传说。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“老奶奶的奶奶，那可真是很久以前的事了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12463"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“神社？神社……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12496"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“……这座岛上的神社叫什么名字？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“鸣濑神社。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“鸣濑？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是说山顶上那座神社吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“对啊。”"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":359,"value":["==",["v",7],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啊，说起来良一好像提到过这事。"},{"op":"goto","target":361},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“原来那里叫鸣濑神社啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咦？鸣濑……白羽？"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12610"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“鸣濑……鸣濑……神社……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么了，识？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12618"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“…………”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"难得见她以如此认真的表情思考着。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12592"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“……好！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后她又以惊人的气势将剩下的一大半刨冰一扫而空。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12556"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“多谢款待，羽依里！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识放下空碗，站了起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喂，你打算去哪？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12559"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“去神社。我先走啦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“喂等等，去是可以去，但是你――”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12574"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"识刚准备跑出去，却没走几步就停了下来，随即扑通一声倒在了地上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咕噜噜～……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“还饿着肚子吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12570"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“羽依里，冰做成的御结饭团果真填不饱肚子啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我知道啦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12576"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“而且……头好痛……呜呜……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“毕竟你吃得那么快，可不就这样了吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12471"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“……十分不解……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12483"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“神社我改天再去吧……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12500"},{"op":"text","speaker":"识","text":"“所以，能给我点吃的吗。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“好吧，老奶奶，随便什么都行，来点能填饱肚子的东西。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“好嘞。”"},{"op":"set","variable":438,"value":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]